---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="P3｜AI Platform Evolution｜J 的世界 Research">

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-inner">
    <div class="kicker">RESEARCH · VOL.01 · P3</div>
    <h1>四個訊號如何共同打造下一代 AI 平台？</h1>
    <p>
      AI Platform Evolution 的核心：
      四條技術路徑正在逐步收斂。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">

  <div class="grid">

    <article class="map-card">
      <div class="number">01</div>
      <h2>Compute Scaling</h2>
      <p>
        先進製程持續提升運算密度，
        同時要求更高能源效率。
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="map-card">
      <div class="number">02</div>
      <h2>Advanced Packaging</h2>
      <p>
        CoWoS、SoIC、SoW 等架構，
        將晶片、記憶體與系統推向更高密度。
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="map-card">
      <div class="number">03</div>
      <h2>Optical Interconnect</h2>
      <p>
        當高速電互連受到頻寬、距離與功耗限制，
        光互連的重要性逐步提高。
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="map-card">
      <div class="number">04</div>
      <h2>Materials & Infrastructure</h2>
      <p>
        製程、封裝與互連升級，
        同時推動材料、設備、散熱與電力需求。
      </p>
    </article>

  </div>

</section>

<section class="feature">
  <div class="section">

    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">SYSTEM VIEW</div>
        <h2>四條路徑正在收斂</h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <article class="research-card">

      <div class="flow">
        <span>Compute</span>
        <b>→</b>
        <span>Packaging</span>
        <b>→</b>
        <span>Optical</span>
        <b>→</b>
        <span>Materials</span>
        <b>→</b>
        <span>Infrastructure</span>
      </div>

      <p>
        這不是單一路線的技術替代，
        而是不同技術節點互相牽動，
        最終形成新的 AI Platform。
      </p>

    </article>

  </div>
</section>

<nav class="research-nav">
  <a href="/research/vol01/p2">← P2 · Evidence</a>
  <a href="../">Vol.01 目錄</a>
  <a href="/research/vol01/p4">P4 · Technology →</a>
</nav>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
.map-card h2{font-size:25px;margin:10px 0}
.research-card{border:1px solid #344457;background:rgba(18,27,38,.82);border-radius:18px;padding:34px}
.research-card p{color:#aeb9c6;max-width:850px;margin-top:28px}
.flow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:9px}
.flow span{padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #354457;border-radius:7px;background:#101924}
.flow b{color:#7188a0}
.research-nav{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:0 24px 70px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}
.research-nav a{color:#b8c8d9;font-weight:700}
@media(max-width:800px){.research-card{padding:25px}.flow b{display:none}.research-nav{flex-wrap:wrap}}
</style>
